{"id":5101,"chapter_id":5,"scene_id":513,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"这就是谈判大厅的入口。室内已被严重破坏，墙体崩塌，地面被砸出一个个圆坑。污染尖刺簇拥生长，晶体里流动着黑紫色的光。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"海拉","content":"呵呵，我还没到这儿打过架呢。一会儿等事情解决了，照规矩我得画个涂鸦纪念一下。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"她的声音有点紧张。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"局长你还好吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"不太好，自从进入这里以来，联系卓娅的枷锁就在暴走。你的意识无时无刻不被撕扯着。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"离卓娅很近了，你受到影响也很正常。但这里还有明显不对劲的地方——","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"options":["这里的人都去哪儿了？"],"jump":[8],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"谈判组、守卫，还有等着围剿卓娅的伏兵。那么多聚集在这里的人凭空消失了，没有变成死役，也没有留下尸骸。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"036","content":"……死了，被人杀死了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"036半蹲在一个坑前。那是被某种巨大力量重击形成的痕迹，蛛网状的裂痕自圆心扩散开来，036用手拭过裂缝，带过粘稠的血泥。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"海拉","content":"唔啊——！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"退后！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101012"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"赫卡蒂把你护在身后，但这样的死亡之坑早已遍布地面，将你们包围。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"036","content":"他们没有产生精神污染的痕迹，这些人在污染爆发的瞬间就被消灭了，这是他们仅剩的躯壳。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101014"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"另一头，FAC的队员几乎堆成了小山。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"最终到达这里的人，也失败了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101016"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"海拉","content":"这就是……遗产的力量？太残忍了……","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101017"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"036","content":"黑环还没爆发，我们还有机会。在这种悲剧扩散更广之前。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101018"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"——他指的是杀死卓娅的机会。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"voice":["vo_cgplot_5101020"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":18,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"喝啊——！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101020"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"她还在战斗。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"content":"她就在前方，伴随着膨胀到极致的力量，还有更骇人的翻腾的情绪——愤怒、悲哀、仇恨、以及某种无法控制的冲动。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"options":["卓娅还在战斗"],"jump":[25],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"content":"一切还未结束，我们还有机会。","style":2,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"speaker":"036","content":"……如果有这种可能，那是最好了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101025"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"content":"你需要能稳住她的东西，任何有可能唤醒她的都可以，你得要更多的手段。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"options":["厄尔希有来过吗？"],"jump":[29],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"这里没有别人，爆发后只有我们成功到达这里。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101028"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"speaker":"海拉","content":"要等他吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101029"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"speaker":"036","content":"没有那个时间了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5101030"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"content":"像突然发力的磁场一般，空气中渐渐凝聚出一簇簇黑紫色的扭动变形着的“某物”。当它们双脚落地时，便是你从未见过的强大怪物。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"content":"就像你能感应卓娅一样，<color=#dg1f1f>它</color>也通过枷锁感应到了你。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1}]}